<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 55.5 bln esc avg 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 55.5 bln esc avg 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 55.5 billion escudos of eight-day funds into the money market at an average weighted interest rate of 6.9 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender effective tomorrow.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
